I left out both operations additions. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, so it has no HTTP import for the metadata service and no filesystem or logging import for `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log`. Adding either would mean widening the node's authority in the graph, which is not something the body can do on its own. The output is unaffected.

```wit
package gen:node;

world node {
    use aap:caps/types@0.1.0.{feed-item, classification};

    import aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0;

    export run: func(item: feed-item) -> classification;
}
